# Defense in depth for git archive. The public exporter independently filters
# private paths and checks content. None of these rules erase private history.
[Zz]-* export-ignore
**/[Zz]-*/** export-ignore
/TODO.md export-ignore
/tools/export-public.sh export-ignore
*.parquet export-ignore
*.duckdb export-ignore

# Same case-insensitive private storage directory boundary as the exporter.
[Dd][Aa][Tt][Aa] export-ignore
**/[Dd][Aa][Tt][Aa]/** export-ignore
[Pp][Rr][Ii][Vv][Aa][Tt][Ee] export-ignore
**/[Pp][Rr][Ii][Vv][Aa][Tt][Ee]/** export-ignore
[Aa][Cc][Cc][Oo][Uu][Nn][Tt]-[Ss][Nn][Aa][Pp][Ss][Hh][Oo][Tt][Ss] export-ignore
**/[Aa][Cc][Cc][Oo][Uu][Nn][Tt]-[Ss][Nn][Aa][Pp][Ss][Hh][Oo][Tt][Ss]/** export-ignore
[Tt][Rr][Aa][Dd][Ee]-[Jj][Oo][Uu][Rr][Nn][Aa][Ll][Ss] export-ignore
**/[Tt][Rr][Aa][Dd][Ee]-[Jj][Oo][Uu][Rr][Nn][Aa][Ll][Ss]/** export-ignore
[Kk][Ee][Yy][Ss][Tt][Oo][Rr][Ee][Ss] export-ignore
**/[Kk][Ee][Yy][Ss][Tt][Oo][Rr][Ee][Ss]/** export-ignore
